{"language":"kr","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","跳跃射击"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/kr","점프 사격"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","向远处跳跃，同时对目标射击。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/kr","먼 곳으로 점프하며 목표를 항해 사격한다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择自身周围2格内的地图格并跳跃至该位置，同时向距离原位置最近的2名敌人射击，造成125% + 15% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","자신 주변 2칸 내의 맵 칸을 선택하여 해당 위치로 점프하는 동시에 기존 위치에 가장 가까운 적 2명을 향해 사격해 125% + 15% ATK의 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":45,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":69,"end":75,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":41,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":65,"end":79,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","跳跃范围提升至自身周围3格内的地图格。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","점프 범위가 자신 주변 3칸 내의 맵 칸으로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至135% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 135% + 15% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至145% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 145% + 15% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/descriptio