 속도가 25 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","提升11% + 1%攻击力。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","공격력이 11% + 1% 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":10,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","提升14% + 1%攻击力。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","공격력이 14% + 1% 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":10,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","提升17% + 1%攻击力。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","공격력이 17% + 1% 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":10,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/kr","영웅 마스터리"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身暴击增幅。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/kr","자신의 치명타 증폭이 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击增幅提升30点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 치명타 증폭이 30 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击增幅提升40点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 치명타 증폭이 40 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的暴击增幅提升50点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 치명타 증폭이 50 증가한다."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","战场学习"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/kr","전장 학습"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","友军释放终极技能时，自身提升攻击力，且该效果叠加至上限后，自身普通攻击将造成真实伤害。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/kr","아군이 궁극기 시전 시 자신의 공격력이 증가하며, 해당 효과가 최대 중첩 도달 후 자신의 일반 공격이 고정 대미지를 입히게 된다."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","其他友军使用终极技能时，梅瑞特的攻击力提升5%，该效果最多叠加6次。叠加至上限后，普通攻击造成真实伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","다른 아군이 궁극기 사용 시 메린의 공격력이 5% 증가한다(최대 6스택 중첩 가능). 최대 중첩 도달 후 일반 공격이 고정 대미지를 입히게 된다."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“专注”每累计生效10秒，额外叠加一层“战场学习”。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","집중 효과가 10초 누적될 때마다 전장 학습이 1스택 추가로 중첩된다."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每层提升的攻击力提升至7.5%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","중첩당 증가하는 공격력이 7.5%로 증가한다."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每层提升的攻击力提升至8.5%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","중첩당 증가하는 공격력이 8.5%로 증가한다."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/kr","각성의 힘"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“专注”的触发门槛降低。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/kr","스킬 집중의 발동 조건이 감소한다."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“专注”触发所需的周围没有敌人的范围缩短-1格。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","스킬 집중 발동에 필요한 주변에 적이 없는 범위가 -1칸 감소한다."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","猎风者"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/kr","윈드 헌터"]]}